{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE: THE WANNABE ALCHEMIST IS STILL IN EARLY ACCESS AND NOT A COMPLETE GAME. </strong>It was released as a full game, which cannot be now changed on Steam. The game should achieve its final form by the end of 2025. Thank you for understanding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/07082b5f6a36300ddab3673a3b3dd868.avif?t=1757700785\" width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/eed9b5b7bc1072288f95edc8b2eb12af.poster.avif?t=1757700785\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/eed9b5b7bc1072288f95edc8b2eb12af.webm?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/eed9b5b7bc1072288f95edc8b2eb12af.mp4?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Though a bit clumsy, Nora has a heart full of kindness and the purest intentions. Even though she struggled at Witchcraft School, it doesn't discourage her from pursuing her dream - becoming a world-famous alchemist! Join Nora on her thrilling journey and support her as she proves that she indeed can achieve her ambitious goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/22fb1493cc35bb70e2c449293c81e9a7.avif?t=1757700785\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/d3b8d19652f8b866c74fbab775406244.poster.avif?t=1757700785\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/d3b8d19652f8b866c74fbab775406244.webm?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/d3b8d19652f8b866c74fbab775406244.mp4?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with simple, basic potions\u00a0and gradually sharpen your skills to uncover up to 50 new recipes!\u00a0Each mixture requires different ingredients and preparation, and one of your tasks will be to ensure that their production is smooth and uninterrupted.\u00a0Fulfill your customers' orders, sell your wares, and advance in the mysterious art of potion-crafting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/09a1059c232e0cf26bf8173f9950d8a3.avif?t=1757700785\" width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/af907e6681dcb73551b47b6c7b8b4fb8.poster.avif?t=1757700785\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/af907e6681dcb73551b47b6c7b8b4fb8.webm?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/af907e6681dcb73551b47b6c7b8b4fb8.mp4?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vibrantly illustrated point-and-click game pits klutziness against good intentions \u2013 a ticking clock against wilting houseplants. Move into Nora\u2019s cozy-but-cluttered witch\u2019s cottage, brew more than 50 powerful potions and achieve domestic bliss in this truly magical visual novel / time management hybrid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/a4481b7f2a5e7f2a047018358717a0dc.avif?t=1757700785\" width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/4b46fc7221d2562340df0e7618121fb7.poster.avif?t=1757700785\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/4b46fc7221d2562340df0e7618121fb7.webm?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/4b46fc7221d2562340df0e7618121fb7.mp4?t=1757700785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventure, you are sure to meet many interesting and truly intriguing characters. Take your time to chat with them all and\u00a0immerse yourself deeper into the magical world of spells, potions and fun.\u00a0Who knows, maybe some of them will become your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798720/extras/bb9159d8b5ce550dcc9fbb75dd90a6ab.avif?t=1757700785\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Brew potions and fulfill orders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Grow and harvest alchemical plants\u2026\u00a0or sell them for money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Decorate and upgrade rooms of your hut</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hone and upgrade your abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Collect more than 20 unique ingredients</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoy the cozy and relaxing nature of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Butterflies Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/027518e7bed78def9f1c8a3d021ac94f3f5e37dd.jpg"},{"name":"Feathers Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/69a1e20cd00c77467efdb7e0783b5d69245e29d2.jpg"},{"name":"Fruits Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/8b518516f135efec52001771f26a00d0881cdc62.jpg"},{"name":"Ladybugs Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/708602951c77637adc108d37a0f31001de56576a.jpg"},{"name":"Leaves Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/474fefa19bb53796d28460badd887bc19ede5780.jpg"},{"name":"Minor Potion of Strength I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/94fd8858afb015cddbd2d66038c71ddf72218900.jpg"},{"name":"Minor Potion of Strength II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/583ae727593e15a605e247f47ad7f06d63db390b.jpg"},{"name":"Minor Potion of Strength III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/13ec92d8736db0c6360b559a126d5a58424ebfba.jpg"},{"name":"Minor Potion of Health I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1798720/90165dd37ff4f7251cdf1d0f0766d598220ddb82.jpg"},{"name":"Minor Potion of Health II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam